# 5. JavaScript / TypeScript

This is where VS Code's language-server features become especially useful.

For example:

```ts
const user = {
    name: "Mike",
    age: 30
};
```

If you type:

```ts
user.
```

VS Code can suggest:

```text
name
age
```

