# 25. TypeScript project

A typical project:

```text
my-project/
│
├── src/
│   ├── main.ts
│   ├── app.ts
│   └── utils.ts
│
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json
└── node_modules/
```

The important file is:

```text
tsconfig.json
```

It controls how TypeScript behaves.

For example:

```json
{
    "compilerOptions": {
        "target": "ES2022",
        "module": "ESNext",
        "strict": true
    }
}
```

VS Code reads this configuration and uses it for TypeScript analysis.

