# 27. Debug JavaScript / TypeScript

VS Code has an integrated debugger.

Important shortcuts:

| Action                | Shortcut      |
| --------------------- | ------------- |
| Start Debugging       | `F5`          |
| Run Without Debugging | `Ctrl + F5`   |
| Toggle Breakpoint     | `F9`          |
| Step Over             | `F10`         |
| Step Into             | `F11`         |
| Step Out              | `Shift + F11` |
| Continue              | `F5`          |
| Stop                  | `Shift + F5`  |

For example:

```ts
function calculate(a: number, b: number) {
    const result = a + b;
    return result;
}
```

Set a breakpoint:

```text
F9
```

Then start debugging:

```text
F5
```

You can inspect:

```text
Variables
Watch
Call Stack
Debug Console
```

